{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxKillswitch\/documentation\/SwiduxKillswitch\/KillswitchService\/live(endpoint:fetchTimeout:cacheLifetime:session:)"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"live"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"endpoint"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation3URLV","text":"URL"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"fetchTimeout"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@NSTimeInterval","text":"TimeInterval"},{"kind":"text","text":" = 10, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"cacheLifetime"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@NSTimeInterval","text":"TimeInterval"},{"kind":"text","text":" = 3600, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"session"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSURLSession","text":"URLSession"},{"kind":"text","text":" = .shared) -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxKillswitch\/documentation\/SwiduxKillswitch\/KillswitchService","preciseIdentifier":"s:16SwiduxKillswitch0B7ServiceV","text":"KillswitchService"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The endpoint must be HTTPS ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"http"},{"type":"text","text":" is allowed only for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"localhost"},{"type":"text","text":" \/"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"127.0.0.1"},{"type":"text","text":" development servers) — the killswitch is a remote control"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"channel and must not be tamperable in transit, regardless of the host"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app’s ATS configuration. The transfer is aborted the moment the response"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"body exceeds 1 MB (it is streamed, never fully buffered past the cap),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and non-2xx statuses are treated as fetch failures (the plugin then"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"falls back to its cache)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"The cache is the other input path","anchor":"The-cache-is-the-other-input-path","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A cached config produces a verdict with exactly the authority a fetched"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one has, and it is reached without any successful fetch ever having"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"happened — launch offline and the failure path loads it directly. So it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is scoped and checked rather than trusted:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It lives in a "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"bundle-scoped subdirectory"}]},{"type":"text","text":" of the caches directory."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"On a non-sandboxed macOS build ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".cachesDirectory"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"~\/Library\/Caches"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"shared by the whole user account, so a bare filename would have every","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Swidux app reading every other’s blocked verdict.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It records the "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"endpoint it came from","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxKillswitch\/documentation\/SwiduxKillswitch\/KillswitchService\/loadCached","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" treats a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"payload written for a different one as absent. Repointing the endpoint"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"therefore invalidates the cache rather than inheriting it."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Neither of those makes the file authenticated. A process running as the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"user can still write it on a platform where the caches directory isn’t","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sandboxed — see ","type":"text"},{"text":"doc:SecurityPosture","type":"text"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Type Method","externalID":"s:16SwiduxKillswitch0B7ServiceV4live8endpoint12fetchTimeout13cacheLifetime7sessionAC10Foundation3URLV_S2dSo12NSURLSessionCtFZ","title":"live(endpoint:fetchTimeout:cacheLifetime:session:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"live"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"endpoint"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation3URLV","text":"URL"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"fetchTimeout"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@NSTimeInterval","text":"TimeInterval"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"cacheLifetime"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@NSTimeInterval","text":"TimeInterval"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"session"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","precis